# Recorded input for the tooltip example page (widgets/tooltip.zig, `Example`), at 800 x 600 in
# the default theme, 0.2 s per frame: the button "Save" at x 8..58, y 8..42; its tooltip, once
# shown, at x 8..217, y 48..78. The delay is 0.5 s. One line per frame says what it does
# (format: input.Replay). Key 41 is Escape (USB HID).
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 800 600
dt 0.2
pointer 400 300
# 1: rest on the button: 0.2 s
frame
pointer 33 25
# 2: 0.4 s
frame
# 3: 0.6 s: shown
frame
# 4: still shown
frame
# 5: leave: hidden
frame
pointer 400 300
# 6: back on the button: 0.2 s
frame
pointer 33 25
# 7: 0.4 s
frame
# 8: 0.6 s: shown
frame
# 9: Escape: hidden
frame
press 41
# 10: still on the button: stays hidden
frame
# 11: leave
frame
pointer 400 300
